# Ensoul Artifact sets base power and toughness (CR 613.4b, layer 7b), so a pump that began before it still applies on
# top (CR 613.4c; the ruling: "Effects that modify a creature's power and/or toughness ... will apply to the creature no
# matter when they started to take effect"). Giant Growth makes Ornithopter 3/5 first; Ensoul Artifact then makes it 8/8,
# not 5/5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Ensoul Artifact
Giant Growth
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ensoul Artifact.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 8
